{"body":{"model":"opus","reads":{"$ref":"01M6S09BX5DDBXFS8D3EQZG0QR"},"seedFrom":"inside","top":{"$ref":"01M6S74NM6HHMXQ1J838NX8T2V"},"understandings":[{"$ref":"01M6S74NM6HHMXQ1J838NX8T2V"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NM73GG1V9V4YP0WS4YM"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NM8HQGFDYT5GYKVM4K7"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NM9713WEVD30ZGCYK3A"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NMARTJFSNYCEMRZKRV2"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NMB29EZGB1A8QBJXEXC"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NMC8JB348R3FZX9HQ8K"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NMDE5E6BVFEPC97J7M9"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NMEKXR0K6QG27DYAA1K"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NMFH8HA5A08FPMW93FN"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NMG3MPS98XZD6QABGXF"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NMH5MDP91EY3RBRCXCC"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NMJAYEEB8X9HJZ9HXHJ"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NMKG99KDSPNADRPZK6T"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NMMAJTTA9NH86P9KZRE"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NMNVMCS69394HYPAXJ9"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NMPWYJ4YCFWS1RVZPZA"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NMQ4747J4G92W75NT4B"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NMRCKQV9RGMSHHXWTPM"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NMS574TA20BZ0HD74WE"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NMTNCW95ABBRNWZNEJ9"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NMV5V9WTP9SMPDBV2SX"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NMWNQZ1Q90Q91NK1K0A"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NMX6986VBRR3J7EXJCA"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NMYY8SDRWFTVNBYTPPN"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NMZP2069ESR89SFNNZN"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NN0YGS0RZP20HCHWWXR"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NN17F0KFV5HSGFNT9M5"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NN277FQ9ATP4RTR7FJW"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NN3QS8EMBH7NEQ32GME"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NN4Q66YKFA2VZBMVBQV"}]},"id":"01M6S74NN588TJ69BRP4Q4YQF6","instance":["01M6S74NG0JR8Q2S499AF7FR71"],"kind":"version","name":"branch-05","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"where the final say comes to rest","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S74NM73GG1V9V4YP0WS4YM"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NMTNCW95ABBRNWZNEJ9"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NN3QS8EMBH7NEQ32GME"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NN4Q66YKFA2VZBMVBQV"}],"prose":"The held space describes a society of parts that is said to need no centre, and then, wherever the parts must agree, places something above them with the last word. Everything else in it, faculties, meaning, simulation, the rural ground, is arranged around that rising seat of authority.","title":"A headless whole that grows a head"},"id":"01M6S74NM6HHMXQ1J838NX8T2V","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"how difference among parts is held together","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S74NMNVMCS69394HYPAXJ9"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NM8HQGFDYT5GYKVM4K7"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NMB29EZGB1A8QBJXEXC"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NMH5MDP91EY3RBRCXCC"}],"prose":"How the parts are given distinct faculties, how they come to disagree, how something settles their disagreements, and the shared speech that makes settling possible.","title":"The working society of parts"},"id":"01M6S74NM73GG1V9V4YP0WS4YM","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"which faculty a part carries","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S74NMPWYJ4YCFWS1RVZPZA"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NMQ4747J4G92W75NT4B"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NMRCKQV9RGMSHHXWTPM"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NMS574TA20BZ0HD74WE"}],"prose":"Capacities a single agent would hold together, judging, seeing, foreseeing, are separated and handed to different kinds of part, which then must feed one another.","title":"Faculties dealt out to parts"},"id":"01M6S74NMNVMCS69394HYPAXJ9","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"what counts as a fair or right decision","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S093679WVYX9W76WMQSFYF"},{"$ref":"01M6S093AKQX05TGPX6C9SX1YG"},{"$ref":"01M6S093D1G6HQ1AF4PPZ6Z3M4"},{"$ref":"01M6S0949YC2RGE7SVC8VQ2BJA"},{"$ref":"01M6S094DC83NRPYHDHCDK6Z0T"},{"$ref":"01M6S094EZEHMWPGCTN09CMTBK"},{"$ref":"01M6S094G14MVA149MAHGZ3JBG"},{"$ref":"01M6S094K282XW4C3DANB6FYG7"},{"$ref":"01M6S0974ESZ3BC4PQGRAQ140D"},{"$ref":"01M6S0976Z3XG1JS1A2VTTTBZN"}],"prose":"One part keeps to rules of right and wrong, another checks for skew; both appear later as validation layers that inspect what others produce.","title":"Faculties of judgment"},"id":"01M6S74NMPWYJ4YCFWS1RVZPZA","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"how much of the situation is seen, and by whom","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S093YQ6AXJZ5BM1HF4WFQX"},{"$ref":"01M6S0941499S7BC44BDW6VFZ3"},{"$ref":"01M6S0943RC500MSJR3TQ6FQP3"},{"$ref":"01M6S0944TNASX9K8JK5V5RTRP"},{"$ref":"01M6S094NQQR6J9EGV6K49FTZS"},{"$ref":"01M6S094QH86CGJ2VPFEPRMBRA"},{"$ref":"01M6S094RFB8ZYRDV9DDW98ERX"},{"$ref":"01M6S094SYAEG8KEJ8AW61YRGQ"},{"$ref":"01M6S094VHECP7DNYBAFKGW3ZP"},{"$ref":"01M6S094XMKX1YC7SH2K1A4ZDZ"}],"prose":"One part turns scattered data into a grasp of the situation, another keeps that grasp shared across levels so local choices do not drift from the whole.","title":"Faculties of perception"},"id":"01M6S74NMQ4747J4G92W75NT4B","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"how far ahead consequences are counted","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S093JWWSFCKGZGR3EF21M7"},{"$ref":"01M6S093NFQRR88X9PD990GSFB"},{"$ref":"01M6S093PESAZNQ254MP8QMHMG"},{"$ref":"01M6S093W4DZ6B9GKDGMNA5DED"}],"prose":"The effective part differs from the efficient one only in how far ahead and how widely it counts consequences, which makes it hard to measure.","title":"Effectiveness as a longer horizon"},"id":"01M6S74NMRCKQV9RGMSHHXWTPM","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"the direction of flow between faculties","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S094Z5HFC2AJXX9P288K6H"},{"$ref":"01M6S0950DPJQCE6FKYH7TSD58"},{"$ref":"01M6S0951AZ5JE4ABRCQSXWQ2F"},{"$ref":"01M6S0953BG3WSGDTSRPS30552"},{"$ref":"01M6S0953C5H9DMB8CRTPS6YK3"}],"prose":"The faculties are wired in a flow: judgment and perception feed the effective part, and the watcher spans every layer.","title":"Faculties feeding one another"},"id":"01M6S74NMS574TA20BZ0HD74WE","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"which aim yields when aims collide","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S74NM9713WEVD30ZGCYK3A"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NMARTJFSNYCEMRZKRV2"}],"prose":"Once parts carry different values, safety against speed, fairness against yield, their aims collide, and the collision is resolved one level up rather than among peers.","title":"Disagreement needs a mediator"},"id":"01M6S74NM8HQGFDYT5GYKVM4K7","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"the trade between harm and haste","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S093FSPTEATFTYCNEJEMQ4"},{"$ref":"01M6S093W4DZ6B9GKDGMNA5DED"},{"$ref":"01M6S0950DPJQCE6FKYH7TSD58"},{"$ref":"01M6S097S811FX4ENN201BA6PM"},{"$ref":"01M6S093C3FHWQ6C5YRWRHZ9BN"},{"$ref":"01M6S093NFQRR88X9PD990GSFB"}],"prose":"The recurring friction is between doing right and doing fast; it is named as a challenge for the ethical part, for the effective part, and again when the two must be reconciled.","title":"Conscience against speed"},"id":"01M6S74NM9713WEVD30ZGCYK3A","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"what the arbiter may and may not touch","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S097VCBK9XZ25KFJF0ND5N"},{"$ref":"01M6S0997JNB7G6FJ23GTB226M"},{"$ref":"01M6S09710AV583QD1MPBPW32H"},{"$ref":"01M6S097S811FX4ENN201BA6PM"}],"prose":"Conflicts are settled by fixed priorities or by adaptive strategies, always without reaching inside a part's own logic, only by steering what it receives and when it acts.","title":"Arbitration by rule or by learning"},"id":"01M6S74NMARTJFSNYCEMRZKRV2","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"how much power the top part holds","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S74NMC8JB348R3FZX9HQ8K"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NMDE5E6BVFEPC97J7M9"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NMEKXR0K6QG27DYAA1K"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NMFH8HA5A08FPMW93FN"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NMG3MPS98XZD6QABGXF"}],"prose":"The interoperability holon begins as a connector and ends as the superholon with the highest authority, its core a language model choosing and composing workflows.","title":"The seat that appears at the top"},"id":"01M6S74NMB29EZGB1A8QBJXEXC","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"the autonomy each part is promised","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S08YN14HRJCEVFSBB1SNPM"},{"$ref":"01M6S08ZQJDTPV1K5MVEQB7EKC"},{"$ref":"01M6S095E1M1ENNRVMHW352873"},{"$ref":"01M6S095RQV1YWJ0PTP40VJPNM"},{"$ref":"01M6S096SSRKHN58F6YBT2PD3S"},{"$ref":"01M6S099B342ME391EQMJR2ENW"},{"$ref":"01M6S09BAGXSGTE19VJ36NDS5M"}],"prose":"Again and again the text promises coordination without central control, autonomy kept, federation instead of integration.","title":"The vow of no centre"},"id":"01M6S74NMC8JB348R3FZX9HQ8K","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"the rank actually written in","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S08ZK9JNT733QPVPKKPB33"},{"$ref":"01M6S09710AV583QD1MPBPW32H"},{"$ref":"01M6S0988S3MZFMVE7H1RCZSJZ"},{"$ref":"01M6S09A5WEFJY26M01RF4RE1F"},{"$ref":"01M6S09AG184GYEQ79ZCXADC7B"},{"$ref":"01M6S09A2TPJHK2PYS75HJWY0Y"}],"prose":"Alongside the vow stand plain statements of rank: top holons hold most authority, a guide is needed to synchronise the merely efficient, and in the case study one holon outranks all.","title":"Authority admitted"},"id":"01M6S74NMDE5E6BVFEPC97J7M9","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"the setting of the autonomy dial","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S0932TYVDNG7V3F9FPTYPQ"},{"$ref":"01M6S098M0RG9CGW3VBAQ8E35X"},{"$ref":"01M6S0997JNB7G6FJ23GTB226M"}],"prose":"How far the top may reach is left adjustable: parts are not necessarily fully autonomous, and the workflow builders can be removed so the top only watches execution.","title":"Autonomy as a dial"},"id":"01M6S74NMEKXR0K6QG27DYAA1K","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"what kind of mind sits in the seat","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S0988S3MZFMVE7H1RCZSJZ"},{"$ref":"01M6S098BNS851MZHX3SFT2NYC"},{"$ref":"01M6S098ECD82QGT0KGXZG1EAS"},{"$ref":"01M6S098FH9YH6FMBTFF272DJA"},{"$ref":"01M6S098GRA69D8E61BGJ3ETJF"},{"$ref":"01M6S098HDWNMXMGHDKP7HYH0G"}],"prose":"The deciding and translating components are proposed as language models, chosen for their reasoning and for adapting to unfamiliar inputs; around them a graph of capabilities lets elements be found and chained.","title":"A language model in the chair"},"id":"01M6S74NMFH8HA5A08FPMW93FN","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"whether watching is also ruling","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S0978GWDT0ZWN8XT22K2EJ"},{"$ref":"01M6S0953BG3WSGDTSRPS30552"},{"$ref":"01M6S08ZT4PVPYCGQYJV7PR3M5"},{"$ref":"01M6S094NQQR6J9EGV6K49FTZS"}],"prose":"The part meant to keep shared awareness turns out to be the one that oversees all others; vigilance and command are named as the same role.","title":"Watcher and conductor become one"},"id":"01M6S74NMG3MPS98XZD6QABGXF","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"how meaning crosses a boundary","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S74NMJAYEEB8X9HJZ9HXHJ"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NMKG99KDSPNADRPZK6T"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NMMAJTTA9NH86P9KZRE"}],"prose":"Parts can only be steered if their words can be carried across; most of the machinery is about making meaning travel between vocabularies that were never agreed.","title":"Meaning as the medium of coordination"},"id":"01M6S74NMH5MDP91EY3RBRCXCC","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"the lifespan of a shared meaning","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S09654M23DFDXTHS52MBXA"},{"$ref":"01M6S097JQCMENMDG4DXR4V4ZJ"},{"$ref":"01M6S0992KZHB02ZBDX260T244"},{"$ref":"01M6S097N1AM8EGG88P63ZS8D9"}],"prose":"Instead of one lasting vocabulary, small temporary ones are built at runtime for a task, used, and discarded, so that a newcomer can be understood without prior agreement.","title":"Meanings made for the moment"},"id":"01M6S74NMJAYEEB8X9HJZ9HXHJ","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"which wall is being crossed","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S095GRG93K5EG2K71B1CKV"},{"$ref":"01M6S095HBYZ649HND3ZYXDXYT"},{"$ref":"01M6S095HYCF58A43XBQ8GAQ7Q"},{"$ref":"01M6S095KGFWMBWNW19K2CKDZC"},{"$ref":"01M6S095NRWBNYWJEQPXGFXTC5"},{"$ref":"01M6S095PBA4ZRBXY1GY14VWHR"},{"$ref":"01M6S095Q6V5YHG5EJ40PT2KHP"},{"$ref":"01M6S095RQV1YWJ0PTP40VJPNM"},{"$ref":"01M6S099046TN4NZCBCFH60P0M"},{"$ref":"01M6S096NJ1YCGW3GT69CTCK3B"}],"prose":"Incompatibilities are sorted into conceptual, organisational and technical walls across data, service, process and business, and three ways through are compared, of which only federation leaves each side its own form.","title":"Kinds of wall and ways through"},"id":"01M6S74NMKG99KDSPNADRPZK6T","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"what a faculty is made of","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S08Z79ESR6PT11B13KVPB3"},{"$ref":"01M6S093AKQX05TGPX6C9SX1YG"},{"$ref":"01M6S0941499S7BC44BDW6VFZ3"},{"$ref":"01M6S0949YC2RGE7SVC8VQ2BJA"},{"$ref":"01M6S094DC83NRPYHDHCDK6Z0T"},{"$ref":"01M6S09474K3F10PRDVM1JZJ06"},{"$ref":"01M6S094H6M3N8CRFWQ98BWV6P"}],"prose":"Ethics, understanding and fairness are each to be built from formal vocabularies: of norms, of domains, of known biases. The faculties are distinct but rest on one substrate.","title":"Ontology underneath every faculty"},"id":"01M6S74NMMAJTTA9NH86P9KZRE","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"whether the reflection keeps the shape of what it reflects","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S74NMV5V9WTP9SMPDBV2SX"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NMZP2069ESR89SFNNZN"}],"prose":"The society of parts is shown twice over: once in a simulation of itself, once laid onto country roads. In both the same rank reappears.","title":"The whole seen in its mirrors"},"id":"01M6S74NMTNCW95ABBRNWZNEJ9","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"how much the modelled control the model","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S74NMWNQZ1Q90Q91NK1K0A"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NMX6986VBRR3J7EXJCA"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NMYY8SDRWFTVNBYTPPN"}],"prose":"The parts are not only modelled; they are allowed to direct the model they are in, and the simulation becomes a subordinate copy of the system that reports upward.","title":"Simulation that the simulated steer"},"id":"01M6S74NMV5V9WTP9SMPDBV2SX","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"what is inherited and what is added","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S091PP1ZZQG6WZ7R3BMA7Q"},{"$ref":"01M6S091YM28K8SWNXGQD94QWR"},{"$ref":"01M6S092GHEZCKHBE4ZKEW3J78"},{"$ref":"01M6S09BPKS0KGT7SR4GE75ACB"}],"prose":"Agent-directed simulation and its emergence stories are inherited, with structure and levels added, to coin a new term.","title":"From agents to holons in simulation"},"id":"01M6S74NMWNQZ1Q90Q91NK1K0A","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"the degree to which a part rewrites the run","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S092KE6ZMECGQSSQBF90BV"},{"$ref":"01M6S092MRCB5DHW2QJWZCMH6P"},{"$ref":"01M6S092NT1X7H7BGXEJM161WB"},{"$ref":"01M6S092PS96FXNTYW0G07YCMZ"},{"$ref":"01M6S092QP2J2DR6DJZ6E197EW"},{"$ref":"01M6S092RHVP4CPW8DAZR8Q3QP"},{"$ref":"01M6S092RXW7KF4BQKGGRPEJTG"}],"prose":"Parts range from mere data sources to ones that rewrite the rules and objectives of the run.","title":"Degrees of steering"},"id":"01M6S74NMX6986VBRR3J7EXJCA","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"how errors travel upward","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S09AH0YMYNDBY3FA44T68F"},{"$ref":"01M6S09AXT9RAEXAGQP942K710"},{"$ref":"01M6S09B0KJPXKB931FZC1JHE3"},{"$ref":"01M6S09B4PEE2MM0G40XAMDENJ"},{"$ref":"01M6S09AH1PWXPQSYN6X82S0CZ"}],"prose":"Each part gets a federate twin; a manager twin with authority bounded to the run sits under the top part, errors are flagged and passed up, and the run ends in scoring and possible restart.","title":"The federated mirror"},"id":"01M6S74NMYY8SDRWFTVNBYTPPN","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"whether absence becomes visible","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S74NN0YGS0RZP20HCHWWXR"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NN17F0KFV5HSGFNT9M5"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NN277FQ9ATP4RTR7FJW"}],"prose":"The framework is cast onto sparse country transport, where the aim is both routing travellers and seeing where no transport exists at all.","title":"The rural ground"},"id":"01M6S74NMZP2069ESR89SFNNZN","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"what gaps are detected","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S099H77DWSEH2T534Q8NP8"},{"$ref":"01M6S099P1AJBBMKJ6BC76WM36"},{"$ref":"01M6S099QDK964CYS5R06EN4WT"},{"$ref":"01M6S09AG184GYEQ79ZCXADC7B"},{"$ref":"01M6S099K16DKC7EQQ35ANCYXH"}],"prose":"Beyond optimising trips, the system is meant to map transit deserts, places noticed by the routes people avoid.","title":"Seeing the absence"},"id":"01M6S74NN0YGS0RZP20HCHWWXR","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"which faculty each actor is given","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S09A2TPJHK2PYS75HJWY0Y"},{"$ref":"01M6S09A5BW0BNN3HVZ12K0BPE"},{"$ref":"01M6S09AB69C8H307DTGBZQJX3"},{"$ref":"01M6S09A2VW9MCRGFVA05NDNK8"},{"$ref":"01M6S099RX7Z7ZGC575Z0RX8W5"}],"prose":"Travellers become understanding parts, services become fair and effective parts, infrastructure becomes watchers, all brought up and synchronised by the top part.","title":"Roles cast onto travellers and roads"},"id":"01M6S74NN17F0KFV5HSGFNT9M5","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"the distance between claim and evidence","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S09BAGXSGTE19VJ36NDS5M"},{"$ref":"01M6S09BD7Q7DNEGX5EB0MJ8HK"},{"$ref":"01M6S09BEWR9X5Z7H9RYYS9WNB"},{"$ref":"01M6S09BX3RAPV03PXJHMR2Z5K"},{"$ref":"01M6S09BKTDMZ0B76G7C8BX946"}],"prose":"Benefits of scale, fairness and lower emissions are asserted, while the closing admits the case is illustration, not validation.","title":"Promise held without proof"},"id":"01M6S74NN277FQ9ATP4RTR7FJW","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
